<title>CANADA: Suncor cuts Canada posted oil prices.</title>
<headline>Suncor cuts Canada posted oil prices.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suncor Inc said it lowered the price it would pay for some grades of crude oil by C$10.00/cubic metre or C$1.59/barrel, effective immediately.</p>
<p>The new prices were listed as follows:</p>
<p>Edmonton light sweet C$201.00/cubic metre, or C$31.96/barrel</p>
<p>Cromer light sour C$195.00/cubic metre, or C$31.00/barrel</p>
<p>Midale at Cromer C$170.00/cubic metre, or C$27.03/barrel</p>
<p>((Reuters Calgary Bureau (403) 531-1624))</p>
</text>
